{"pages":[{"index":0,"markdown":"Photo - Jan 2026\n\n# RAW BAR\n\nCOASTAL OYSTERS (G) DF, GF 28\n\nchilled with cocktail sauce | megnonette\n\nSHRIMP COCKTAIL DF, GF 25\n\ncrab cocktail sauce | lemon\n\nHAMACHI CRUDO* DF, GF 29\n\njalapeño | coconut | lime\n\nCAVIAR SERVICE & TOASTED BRIOCHE MP\n\ntraditional accoutrements\n\nHALF MAINE LOBSTER TAIL 35\n\nchilled or grilled\n\nTAYLOR BAY SCALLOP CEVICHE 28\n\nyuzu | lychee | lavender | lime\n\n# STARTERS\n\nSTEAK TARTARE 27\n\ntruffle toast\n\nCHICKEN TENDERS 24\n\nranch | sweet boq auzi\n\nCRAB CAKE 39\n\nmass cracker | corn relish | smoked tomato butter\n\nCHARRED MOROCCAN BEET v 24\n\ncustomer yogurt | pistachio dukkah | burnt citrus\n\n# SALADS\n\nLITTLE GEM CAESAR 19\n\nnastic house-made croutons | parmigiano reggiano\n\nPEARS & GORGONZOLA 20\n\nhoney vinaigrette | pickled shallots | walnuts\n\nSHAVED BRUSSEL SPROUTS 21\n\ntoasted hazelnuts | crushed red grapes | aged gouda\n\nWARM BURRATA 24\n\ncorn tomatoes | jesper toasted focacia | fresh basil\n\n# GUEST HOUSE\n\nSOCIAL DINING & WINE GARDEN\n\n# SEAFOOD PLATEAU*\n\nchilled or warm / shrimp | maine lobster | king crab\n\nroasted bay scallops | oysters | clams\n\nFOR TWO • 150 - FOR THREE OR MORE • 280\n\n# BUTCHER'S BEST\n\nPRIME TOMAHAWK* GF, DF 6.50 PER OZ\n\nthyme | peppercorn | brown sugar\n\n40-DAY DRY AGED BONE-IN RIBEYE* 20 OZ GF 145\n\nroasted carrot\n\nPARMESAN-CRUSTED FILET* 7 OZ / 10 OZ 65 / 85\n\nroasted allium | veal reduction\n\nBUTCHER'S CUT* GF 63\n\nblack pepper | black garlic | charred broccolini\n\nMISHIMA RESERVE WAGYU NEW YORK* GF 155\n\nshishito peppers | smoked butter | sea salt\n\n# ENHANCEMENTS\n\nFOIE GRAS 26 KING CRAB 48\n\nFRESH SHAVED TRUFFLES (5c) 30 BUTTERED LUMP CRAB 28\n\nBLACK TRUFFLE BUTTER 9 MEXICAN WHITE SHRIMP 7 EA\n\nHALF LOBSTER TAIL 35 OSETRA CAVIAR (3c) 20\n\nCHIMICHURRI 5 BEARNAISE 5\n\nHORSERADISH CREME 5 GH STEAK SAUCE 5\n\nThis menu is a testament to the creativity and passion of our culinary team. Lastly,\n\nTOD